    "detailed_description": "<h1>HELP: THE GAME Compilation</h1><p>This title is one of many included in the HELP: THE GAME Compilation.<br><br>Please click the below image to view all the titles included.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/494970/extras/b1dd3283636a06efcb9215d8057c8278.avif?t=1575643273\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Savana is a narrative point and click game where you play as a young girl from a remote village.<br>The narration of the game tells different story lines from a real life experience of growing up in Mozambique. You play as a young girl called Savana and see first-hand what a typical day in her life is like. <br><br>Helana, project lead, spent her formative years in Africa. During the game she describes her first hand experiences as the game draws out towards its tragic end for Savana.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Studio Message/Creators</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Helana Santos <br></li><li>Hannah Payne<br></li><li>Michael Duwe <br></li><li>Ollie Clarke<br></li><li>Chris Randle</li></ul>",
